id: holstein-shock
name: Holstein Shock
uaType: both
prerequisite: N/A
tpCost: 5
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
# "Make a Wound Roll as if you made an Attacking Maneuver of the Simple Profile (any Foundation). Reduce your Life
# Points by the Dice Score." The Foundation asked with the roll's window (use-maneuver.mjs askShock); rolled and taken
# off your own Life Points (chat.mjs postShock).
selfShock: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Wound Roll of the Simple Profile, any Foundation, off your own Life Points.
text: >
  Holstein Shock: You inflict harm upon yourself in order to gain a psychological or tactical advantage over your
  enemies.
  –Ability Type: Technical/Magical
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –TP Cost: 5
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Make a Wound Roll as if you made an Attacking Maneuver of the Simple Profile (any Foundation). Reduce your
  Life Points by the Dice Score.
